{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28752","headline":"将赴京题陵阳王氏水居 · 杜牧","name":"将赴京题陵阳王氏水居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘卷平芜接远天，暂宽行役到罇前。\n是非境里有闲日，荣辱尘中无了年。\n山簇暮云千野雨，江分秋水九条烟。\n马蹄不道贪西去，争向一声高树蝉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}